/P 754 0 R
/E (Authorize Trade Sanctions: If a member country refuses to alter an illegal trade practice after an adverse ruling, the WTO can authorize the complaining country to impose targeted retaliatory tariffs or trade restrictions against the non-compliant state. )
/Pg 20 0 R
/K [10]
>>
endobj
276 0 obj
<<
