/S /P
/P 757 0 R
/E (Unilaterally Enforce Rules or Override Sovereignty: The WTO cannot bypass member consensus, enact legislation independently, or compel sovereign states to adopt specific policies without their explicit consent, as it operates entirely as a member-driven body. )
/Pg 20 0 R
/K [13]
>>
endobj
279 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 758 0 R
