/E (Fifth, the WTO possesses an explicit development-focused mandate to build trade capacity and technical expertise in developing economies and Least Developed Countries \(LDCs\). Through embedded Special and Differential Treatment \(S&DT\) provisions, the WTO mandate grants lower-income states policy flexibilities, extended transition deadlines, and targeted institutional support, ensuring their sustainable integration into global value chains while preserving the domestic fiscal and industrial policy space necessary for national economic development. )
/Pg 20 0 R
/K [17]
