/T (The digital trade agenda at the World Trade Organization \(WTO\) focuses on establishing binding global legal principles for the cross-border exchange of digitally enabled services, electronic data flows, digitized products, and online commercial infrastructure. As physical commercial goods \(such as books, physical media, diagnostic tools, and software distribution disks\) are increasingly converted into intangible digital transmissions, cross-border digital flows have grown into one of the most vital components of global trade.)
/E (The digital trade agenda at the World Trade Organization \(WTO\) focuses on establishing binding global legal principles for the cross-border exchange of digitally enabled services, electronic data flows, digitized products, and online commercial infrastructure. As physical commercial goods \(such as books, physical media, diagnostic tools, and software distribution disks\) are increasingly converted into intangible digital transmissions, cross-border digital flows have grown into one of the most vital components of global trade.)
/Pg 21 0 R
/K [8]
>>
