/E (Developed Nations' Perspective: Advanced economies argue that levying customs duties on invisible, high-speed data flows is technically impractical, introduces severe market friction, and inflates costs for local businesses. They contend that domestic indirect taxes \(such as VAT or GST\) are more efficient tools for revenue generation. )
